1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,880
各位腎友與照護者大家好！歡迎收看成大透析室衛教專欄
Welcome patients and caregivers to NCKUH Hemodialysis Unit health guide!

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:19,220
掌握三大法寶：第一，落實居家血壓七二二
3 Golden Rules: 1. Measure home blood pressure with the 722 rule

3
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:27,230
第二，乾體重增幅小於百分之五
2. Keep interdialytic weight gain strictly under 5% of dry weight

4
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:32,760
第三，降壓藥規律按時服用
3. Take blood pressure medications on time as prescribed

5
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:38,560
讓我們一起護腎保心、血壓穩妥當！
Together let's protect your heart and kidneys for steady blood pressure!

6
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:46,110
一般成年人的血壓標準，建議控制在小於 120/80 毫米汞柱
Healthy adults: Recommended blood pressure is under 120/80 mmHg

7
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:57,090
但洗腎病友體液波動大，建議診間血壓控制在小於 140/90
Dialysis patients: In-clinic BP recommended under 140/90 mmHg

8
00:00:57,090 --> 00:01:05,400
而在家放鬆測量，維持在 120～135 / 60～80 最適當
Home BP when relaxed: Ideal range is 120-135 / 60-80 mmHg

9
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:13,520
血壓不是越低越好，平穩最適當，預防心肌缺氧！
Stable BP is safest to prevent heart strain and sudden hypotension!

10
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:20,660
許多病友在透析室量的血壓起伏大，容易有緊張的白袍效應
Many patients have high in-clinic BP due to anxiety (white coat effect)

11
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:28,620
在熟悉家中放鬆深呼吸，更能精準反映心臟真實負擔
Resting 5 minutes at home gives the most accurate cardiac readings

12
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:35,680
詳細記錄居家血壓，能幫助醫療團隊精準調整治療計畫
Detailed home logs help doctors tailor medication and dry weight

13
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:40,760
破除緊張、看見真實，居家量測最安心！
Ease anxiety and measure at home regularly for true peace of mind!

14
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:46,580
請大家務必牢記居家血壓黃金七二二原則！
Please remember the golden 722 rule for home blood pressure!

15
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:52,180
七：連續測量七天，掌握一週血壓走勢
7: Measure for 7 consecutive days to track weekly trends

16
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:59,370
二：每天早晚各量一次，晨起如廁後與睡前量
2: Measure twice daily (morning after toilet and before bed)

17
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:05,670
二：每次量兩遍，間隔一分鐘取平均值
2: Take 2 readings 1 minute apart and record the average

18
00:02:05,670 --> 00:02:11,800
【桌曆打勾・連續記錄】帶來透析室供醫師評估！
Check your calendar and bring your logbook to the dialysis unit!

19
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:17,980
第二個關鍵是乾體重管理。我們的心臟就像一顆氣球
Key 2: Dry weight management. Your heart behaves like a balloon

20
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:25,940
洗腎間喝水過量，氣球被反覆吹大，心臟擴大、血壓飆高！
Excess fluid over-inflates the heart, enlarging it and spiking BP!

21
00:02:25,940 --> 00:02:33,870
而若脫水太急促，又容易引發肌肉抽筋與低血壓
Rapid ultrafiltration causes severe muscle cramps and hypotension

22
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:39,880
嚴防脹大與驟縮，維持水分平衡才能保護心臟！
Maintain fluid balance at dry weight to keep your heart strong!

23
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:46,640
兩次洗腎之間的體重增加，必須嚴格控制在百分之五以內
Interdialytic weight gain must be strictly kept under 5% of dry weight

24
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:56,010
以乾體重 60 公斤為例，最多只能增加 3 公斤（3 瓶 1000cc 水）
For a 60 kg patient: Max gain is 3 kg, equal to three 1000ml bottles

25
00:02:56,010 --> 00:03:04,590
每天晨起上完廁所後空腹量體重，固定秤、掌握變化
Weigh every morning after toilet, wearing light clothes on the same scale

26
00:03:04,590 --> 00:03:12,360
體重達標洗腎不抽筋，少量多次徹底預防肺積水！
Proper weight control prevents dialysis cramps and pulmonary edema!

27
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:20,480
想要成功控水，一定要限水先限鹽！每日食鹽少於 5 公克
To control fluids, limit salt first! Keep daily salt under 5 grams

28
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:28,130
每天食鹽約一平匙，少吃醃漬加工高鹽食品
Use ~1 level teaspoon daily; avoid canned, pickled, and processed foods

29
00:03:28,130 --> 00:03:39,230
特別鄭重警告：洗腎病友嚴禁食用低鈉鹽，高鉀會引發猝死！
CRITICAL WARNING: Low-sodium salt is STRICTLY FORBIDDEN due to fatal hyperkalemia!

30
00:03:39,230 --> 00:03:47,480
善用蔥、薑、蒜與鮮檸檬等天然辛香料提味，減鹽美味安心！
Flavor meals with scallions, ginger, garlic, and lemon safely!

31
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:56,680
口渴時切勿大口灌水。第一招：口含薄檸檬片刺激唾液
Never gulp water when thirsty. Tip 1: Place a thin lemon slice in mouth

32
00:03:56,680 --> 00:04:01,950
第二招：含一小塊冰塊在口中慢慢融化
Tip 2: Melt a small ice cube slowly in your mouth to quench thirst

33
00:04:01,950 --> 00:04:07,000
第三招：嚼無糖口香糖，滋潤口腔生津止渴
Tip 3: Chew sugar-free gum to keep oral cavity moist

34
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:13,520
第四招：用常溫清水漱口，漱完務必吐掉絕對不吞
Tip 4: Rinse mouth with water and ALWAYS SPIT OUT; never swallow

35
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:18,400
靈活運用解渴四妙招，輕鬆告別口乾煩惱！
Apply these 4 tips to overcome dry mouth comfortably!

36
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:27,410
法寶三：降壓藥按時服！第一步，核對當天透明藥格
Rule 3: Take meds on time! Step 1: Check daily pill organizer

37
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:33,620
第二步，手拿處方箋核對劑量，取出藥物置於手掌心
Step 2: Check prescription dose and place pills in clean palm

38
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:40,320
第三步，配常溫開水順暢嚥下，放緩動作防嗆咳
Step 3: Swallow smoothly with a small sip of water without choking

39
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:46,070
第四步，撫胸順氣比個讚，放鬆身心護健康！
Step 4: Rub chest, breathe calmly, and give a thumbs-up with confidence!

40
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:56,440
血壓正常是藥物在保護，絕不擅自停藥；洗腎早晨遵醫囑！
Normal BP means medicine is working; NEVER stop meds on your own!

41
00:04:56,440 --> 00:05:02,930
最後讓我們複習血液透析控壓四句訣！
Finally, let us review the 4 core BP management rules for dialysis!

42
00:05:02,930 --> 00:05:11,180
第一，居家量七二二：連續七天、早晚量、各量兩遍
1. Measure 722 at home: 7 days, morning & evening, twice each time

43
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:18,340
第二，體重不超五：兩次洗腎間增幅小於百分之五
2. Weight gain under 5%: Interdialytic gain below 5% dry weight

44
00:05:18,340 --> 00:05:26,200
第三，減鹽忌低鈉：每天鹽分少於五公克，嚴禁低鈉鹽
3. Cut salt & avoid low-sodium salt: Under 5g/day, NO low-sodium salt

45
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:37,000
第四，服藥遵醫囑：血壓正常不擅停！成大透析室陪伴健康同行！
4. Follow prescriptions faithfully: NCKUH Hemodialysis Unit is with you!

